    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d656">

                <pb facs="0707" n="695" xml:id="pg695"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.20 Defense (M) Brazil/328: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-03-17T15:00:00-04:00">March 17, 1942—3 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>671. Your 871 of March 14. Firestone and Goodyear will not continue to act, as
                    Rubber Reserve will deal directly with Bank of Brazil.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
